* Fallback 2N3904 NPN model for ENG29 2121 CE amplifier simulator.
* Source basis: commonly used educational 2N3904 SPICE parameterization.
* Override with SPICE_MODEL environment variable if instructor provides a model.
.model QREF NPN(IS=1.4E-14 BF=300 VAF=100 IKF=0.025 ISE=3E-13
+ BR=7.5 RC=2.4 CJE=4.5E-12 TF=4E-10 CJC=3.5E-12 TR=2.1E-8 XTB=1.5 KF=9E-16)
